# ===================================================================
# CONFIGURATION NOTES:
# ===================================================================
# 
# Workspace ID 57 = Items workspace (contains your products/BOMs)
# Tenant: previewdickmans.autodeskplm360.net
# 
# Other available workspaces in your system:
# - Workspace ID 84 = Change Orders
# - Workspace ID 82 = Problem Reports  
# - Workspace ID 86 = Projects
#
# To get your Client ID and Client Secret:
# 1. Go to https://aps.autodesk.com
# 2. Create a new application
# 3. Add callback URLs:
#    - https://www.getpostman.com/oauth2/callback
#    - https://oauth.pstmn.io/v1/browser-callback
# 4. Whitelist the Client ID in Fusion Manage General Settings
#
# To get your Dolibarr API Key:
# 1. Login to Dolibarr as admin
# 2. Go to Home → Setup → Modules/Applications
# 3. Enable "REST API" module
# 4. Go to your user profile → API Key tab
# 5. Generate an API key
# ===================================================================
